  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiang says the ice poison starfish has a troublesome poison, but he has heard that Su Chen and Fairy Jiu Yue can heal it. Su Chen is a member of the super force Su clan, specializes in healing, is famous in Eastern Sea, and is quite a kind person. Miao Ming Shen refuses to turn to him because he is from Su clan, and later the same refusal is restated when Su Chen is attending the qi sea banquet.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiang",
        "fac_su_clan",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_miao_ming_shen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep within icy sea area, Su Chen and Su Ming Wan, both rank seven, travel in Moving Frame Pavilion. Su Chen specializes in healing methods; Su Ming Wan cultivates dark path. They crack thousand year profound ice with a strength path method, and Su Chen moves pieces into his immortal aperture. When ice poison starfish approach, he flies out to lure them away so Su Ming Wan can take as much ice as possible. Sensing Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s aura, he shouts to tell first supreme elder that Giant Sun seems to be moving toward Su clan.",
      "chapters": [
        2230
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-harvest-and-giant-sun-warning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
